sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Visitor as Public sender
    actor Admin as Operations/Admin
    participant Web as Public web page
    participant API as Inquiry API
    participant DB as landing_inquiries and audit records
    Visitor->>Web: Enter inquiry details
    Web->>API: Submit inquiry
    API->>API: Validate and throttle intake
    API->>DB: Store accepted inquiry
    API-->>Visitor: Acknowledge saved inquiry
    Admin->>API: Open inquiry management
    API->>API: Enforce administrative access
    Admin->>API: Review and update inquiry status
    API->>DB: Store authorized status/history
